          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "心里空落落的，这种感觉真不好受。您要是愿意，跟我说说是什么让您觉得空？或者咱们就静静待会儿也行。",
          "chars": 43,
          "sentences": 3,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 986,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "kind": "followup",
          "text": "我在这儿陪着你呢。",
          "chars": 8,
          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 10750,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "十二年的陪伴，突然没了，心里肯定特别难受。它一直安安静静陪在您身边，这份感情真的很难割舍。",
          "chars": 40,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 707,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "这个习惯太让人心疼了。您别急着收碗，让它慢慢凉着，就像它还在一样。",
          "chars": 29,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 735,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "您别这么说自己。十二年的陪伴哪是“一只猫”能概括的，那是家人啊。心里难受是正常的，不是没出息。",
          "chars": 40,
          "sentences": 3,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 725,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "kind": "followup",
          "text": "您摸摸胸口，那暖意还在呢。",
          "chars": 11,
          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
